<title>JAPAN: Toa Steel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toa Steel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 62.65		vs	   64.25</p>
<p> Operating     loss 6.57		vs   loss 835    million</p>
<p> Current	 loss 9.08		vs     loss 2.76</p>
<p> Net	     loss 9.15		vs     loss 2.20</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 65.42 yen	  vs    loss 15.75 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    140 million	  vs	 140 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Toa Steel Co Ltd is an electric furnace steelmaker affiliated with NKK Corp.</p>
